721: *
722: *   This front-end does the following things before calling
723: *   nxsig_tcbdispatch.
724: *
725: *     With HAVE_GROUP_MEMBERS defined:
726: *     - Get the TCB associated with the pid.
727: *     - If the TCB was found, get the group from the TCB.
728: *     - If the PID has already exited, lookup the group that that was
729: *       started by this task.
730: *     - Use the group to pick the TCB to receive the signal
731: *     - Call nxsig_tcbdispatch with the TCB
732: *
733: *     With HAVE_GROUP_MEMBERS *not* defined
734: *     - Get the TCB associated with the pid.
735: *     - Call nxsig_tcbdispatch with the TCB
736: *
737: * Returned Value:
